  evidence: https://github.com/nyuichi/rust-crate-proofs/blob/ad4098c79bb4e8fe7d8d0ba3a63beffe184d5aef/rand_xorshift/0.5.0/aeneas/2026-11-05/proofs/Proofs.lean#L1-L32
